    },
    {
      "id": "p2",
      "text": "In a ruinous yet unavoidable teardown to accelerate AI-driven product work, the architect of the pivot declared the elimination of 3,000 full-time roles. This significant workforce reduction will dissolve positions across the company, with creation sites turning into ruins. The discarded workers received a compensation offer, a severance offering for the discarded, underscoring the severe staff layoff that accompanies such a drastic business strategy.",
